  "Nothing is lost. Anthropic staff sessions need approved security controls, and this one doesn’t have them. Switching to auto mode may fix it. If not, select New session to start one in an approved environment.{hasGoLink, select, true { Learn more at {goLink}.} other {}}": "不会丢失任何内容。Anthropic 员工会话需要经批准的安全控制，而此会话没有。切换到自动模式可能会解决此问题。如果不行，请选择“新会话”，在经批准的环境中开始一个会话。{hasGoLink, select, true { 详情见 {goLink}。} other {}}",
  "You can still read this conversation here. This environment isn’t approved for Anthropic staff sessions, and a session can’t move out of it. Select New session to start one in an approved environment.{hasGoLink, select, true { Learn more at {goLink}.} other {}}": "你仍可以在此阅读这段对话。此环境未获批用于 Anthropic 员工会话，且会话无法迁出此环境。请选择“新会话”，在经批准的环境中开始一个会话。{hasGoLink, select, true { 详情见 {goLink}。} other {}}",
  "Add credits or update billing to continue.": "请充值额度或更新账单信息以继续。",
  "Add credits or update billing with {provider} to continue.": "请在 {provider} 充值额度或更新账单信息以继续。",
  "your provider": "你的服务提供商",
  "You won’t be able to start tasks until your IT team adds credits or updates billing.": "在 IT 团队充值额度或更新账单信息之前，你将无法启动任务。",
  "This session’s SSH connection was removed or replaced": "此会话的 SSH 连接已被移除或替换",
  "Couldn’t check a folder on {host}": "无法检查 {host} 上的文件夹",
  "Ask your IT team to fix your organization’s launcher": "请让 IT 团队修复你组织的启动器",
  "Ask your admin to allow SSH to {host}": "请让管理员允许通过 SSH 连接到 {host}",
  "Add it again to continue.": "重新添加后即可继续。",
  "{host} couldn’t report the real location of one of this session’s folders. Start a new session from paths with no symbolic links.": "{host} 无法报告此会话某个文件夹的真实位置。请从不含符号链接的路径开始新会话。",
  "SSH connections back to this device are turned off too. You can choose another environment, or contact your IT team.": "连回此设备的 SSH 连接也已关闭。你可以选择其他环境，或联系 IT 团队。",
  "You can choose another environment, or contact your IT team.": "你可以选择其他环境，或联系 IT 团队。",
  "Your organization limits workspace folders, which blocks SSH sessions back to this device, including tunnels and port forwards. You can choose another environment, or contact your IT team.": "你的组织限制了工作区文件夹，这会阻止连回此设备的 SSH 会话，包括隧道和端口转发。你可以选择其他环境，或联系 IT 团队。",
  "Your organization no longer allows {host}, so Claude stopped what was running there.": "你的组织已不再允许 {host}，因此 Claude 停止了在那里运行的内容。",
  "Your organization no longer allows {host}, so Claude stopped what was running there and didn’t send your last message.": "你的组织已不再允许 {host}，因此 Claude 停止了在那里运行的内容，且没有发送你的最后一条消息。",
  "Your organization no longer allows {host}, and what Claude was running there may still be running.": "你的组织已不再允许 {host}，Claude 在那里运行的内容可能仍在运行。",
  "Your organization no longer allows {host}, and what Claude was running there may still be running. Your last message wasn’t sent.": "你的组织已不再允许 {host}，Claude 在那里运行的内容可能仍在运行。你的最后一条消息未发送。",
  "Your organization’s model provider settings only work on this computer. You can choose another environment, or ask your IT team about settings that work over SSH.": "你组织的模型提供商设置只能在这台电脑上使用。你可以选择其他环境，或向 IT 团队咨询可通过 SSH 使用的设置。",
