  "You don’t have access to this resource — check your permissions.": "你无权访问此资源，请检查你的权限。",
  "This rule applies only to Anthropic staff accounts. Signing in again won’t help.": "此规则仅适用于 Anthropic 员工账号。重新登录也无济于事。",
  "This rule applies only to Anthropic staff accounts. Signing in again won’t help. Learn more at {goLink}.": "此规则仅适用于 Anthropic 员工账号。重新登录也无济于事。详情见 {goLink}。",
  "This rule applies only to Anthropic staff accounts. Signing in again won’t help. Open View details for the API’s explanation.": "此规则仅适用于 Anthropic 员工账号。重新登录也无济于事。打开“查看详情”可查看 API 的说明。",
  "This rule applies only to Anthropic staff accounts and refuses out-of-date versions of Claude Code, so signing in again won’t help. Update the Claude desktop app, or update Claude Code on the other computer for a remote control session, then start a new session.": "此规则仅适用于 Anthropic 员工账号，并会拒绝过时版本的 Claude Code，因此重新登录无济于事。请更新 Claude 桌面应用；若是远程控制会话，请更新另一台电脑上的 Claude Code，然后开始新会话。",
  "This rule applies only to Anthropic staff accounts and refuses out-of-date versions of Claude Code, so signing in again won’t help. Update the Claude desktop app, or update Claude Code on the other computer for a remote control session, then start a new session. Learn more at {goLink}.": "此规则仅适用于 Anthropic 员工账号，并会拒绝过时版本的 Claude Code，因此重新登录无济于事。请更新 Claude 桌面应用；若是远程控制会话，请更新另一台电脑上的 Claude Code，然后开始新会话。详情见 {goLink}。",
  "This rule applies only to Anthropic staff accounts and refuses Claude Code sessions whose security controls Anthropic hasn’t approved, so signing in again or updating won’t help. You can run the session in an approved environment, or request an exemption.": "此规则仅适用于 Anthropic 员工账号，并会拒绝安全控制未经 Anthropic 批准的 Claude Code 会话，因此重新登录或更新都无济于事。你可以在经批准的环境中运行此会话，或申请豁免。",
  "This rule applies only to Anthropic staff accounts and refuses Claude Code sessions whose security controls Anthropic hasn’t approved, so signing in again or updating won’t help. You can run the session in an approved environment, or request an exemption. Learn more at {goLink}.": "此规则仅适用于 Anthropic 员工账号，并会拒绝安全控制未经 Anthropic 批准的 Claude Code 会话，因此重新登录或更新都无济于事。你可以在经批准的环境中运行此会话，或申请豁免。详情见 {goLink}。",
