  "This often happens when {host} runs out of memory or processes. Send a message to continue. If it keeps happening, archive sessions you no longer need there.": "这通常是因为 {host} 的内存或进程数用尽。发送一条消息以继续。如果反复出现，请归档那里不再需要的会话。",
