  'Directory "{path}" is, or is inside, a protected host location ({root}) and cannot be mounted.': '文件夹“{path}”是受保护的系统位置（{root}）或位于其中，无法挂载。',
  "Folder access isn't available in chat sessions.": "聊天会话无法访问文件夹。",
