  "That folder is a protected location (or the path is invalid) and can't be a trusted folder.": "该文件夹是受保护的位置（或路径无效），不能设为受信任的文件夹。",
  'It may be a protected location, a network location that can’t be used, outside the folders your administrator allows, or unavailable right now. Choose a different folder, or try again.': '它可能是受保护的位置、无法使用的网络位置、不在管理员允许的文件夹范围内，或者暂时不可用。请选择其他文件夹，或稍后重试。',
  'Trusted folder': '受信任的文件夹',
  'Trust this folder on this device?': '要在此设备上信任此文件夹吗？',
  'This is your entire home folder.': '这是你的整个个人文件夹。',
  'This folder contains your entire home folder.': '此文件夹包含你的整个个人文件夹。',
  'This is an entire disk.': '这是一整块磁盘。',
  'The Claude app on this device will no longer show its Allow prompt before Claude uses this folder or the folders inside it. This applies to all future sessions that use this device, including scheduled tasks that run while you’re away. Those sessions can read and modify files here. Claude may still ask in the chat before it adds the folder to a session. Files Claude uses leave your device and are processed on your organization’s infrastructure. You can remove the folder in Settings at any time.': '此设备上的 Claude 应用在 Claude 使用此文件夹或其中的文件夹之前，将不再显示“允许”提示。这适用于今后所有使用此设备的会话，包括你不在时运行的定时任务。这些会话可以读取和修改这里的文件。Claude 在把文件夹加入会话之前，仍可能在对话中询问你。Claude 使用的文件会离开你的设备，并在你的组织的基础设施上处理。你可以随时在设置中移除此文件夹。',
  'Trust folder': '信任文件夹',
  'Unknown Cowork session.': '未知的 Cowork 会话。',
  'Choose a folder.': '请选择一个文件夹。',
  'Unknown folder request.': '未知的文件夹请求。',
  '{path} is inside a protected location (system, credential or Claude-internal data) within a connected folder. It can\'t be listed, read or written from a Cowork session. Nothing else in the connected folder is affected.': '{path} 位于已连接文件夹中的受保护位置（系统、凭据或 Claude 内部数据）。Cowork 会话无法列出、读取或写入它。已连接文件夹中的其他内容不受影响。',
