  'Allow {task} to access this folder on every run?': '允许{task}在每次运行时访问此文件夹吗？',
  'Allow {task} to access these {count} folders on every run?': '允许{task}在每次运行时访问这 {count} 个文件夹吗？',
  "Every run of this task — including runs while you're away — will be able to read and modify files here, and run commands that access these folders, until you remove them from the task or delete it. Because the task runs in the cloud, files it uses leave your device and are processed on Anthropic's servers.": '此任务的每次运行（包括你不在时的运行）都可以读取和修改这里的文件，并运行访问这些文件夹的命令，直到你从任务中移除它们或删除该任务。由于任务在云端运行，它使用的文件会离开你的设备，并在 Anthropic 的服务器上处理。',
